{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into <i>Delirium: Echoes of the Domino \u2014 Demo</i>, an early glimpse of this hypnotic and twisted domino roguelike where every tile can unleash chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the <strong>El Mago</strong> game mode, granting you an extra discard to plan impossible combinations and trigger supernatural powers on an ever-changing board. Face off against the <strong>first 6 bosses</strong>, each with unique rules that will test your strategy and luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover rule-breaking jokers, avoid traps, and build strategic plays as you survive in a shifting world. Every run in this demo is different, bringing you one step closer to unraveling the secrets of the delirium\u2026 or becoming lost within it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841740?t=1751354185","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841740?t=1751354185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841740/6fcb1a73fd38b6e85e2cc619d40a0d9e469bdecc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751354185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841740/6fcb1a73fd38b6e85e2cc619d40a0d9e469bdecc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751354185","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into <i>Delirium: Echoes of the Domino \u2014 Demo</i>, an early glimpse of this hypnotic and twisted domino roguelike where every tile can unleash chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the <strong>El Mago</strong> game mode, granting you an extra discard to plan impossible combinations and trigger supernatural powers on an ever-changing board. Face off against the <strong>first 6 bosses</strong>, each with unique rules that will test your strategy and luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover rule-breaking jokers, avoid traps, and build strategic plays as you survive in a shifting world. Every run in this demo is different, bringing you one step closer to unraveling the secrets of the delirium\u2026 or becoming lost within it.</p>","developers":["Rialuz Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3707610","name":"Delirium: Echoes of the Domino"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841740/adf031b759243964d75c3b427a98b3c58538061a/header.jpg?t=1751354185","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257161203,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161203/movie480.mp4?t=1751353928","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161203/movie_max.mp4?t=1751353928"},"name":"Delirium- Gameplay Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161203/6c549dacde50f5609ed61ce04eaa7102edece9fc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751353928","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161203/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751353928","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161203/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751353928"}}],"name":"Delirium: Echoes of the Domino Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible graphics card, integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</stro